e left joystick on a phone) to walk.WARNING: ASTRO UFO INCOMINGWATCHMAN OF DOOMWAVE WAVE 20: CHIEFWAVE 21: ASTROSWAVE 35: CORRUPTEDWAVE 41: ASTRO HUNTERWAVE 50: G-MAN 1.0WAVE 75WAVE 80: ASTRO DESTRUCTORSWAVE 80: SCIENTISTWAVE 89WAVE 90WAVE 90: MOTHERSHIP + BOSSESWAVE TOKENS: WAVE TOKENS: earn them by clearing waves, getting kills and not getting hitWEAPONWEAPONSWEAPONS: WEAPONS: power up or buy guns. UPGRADES: gear, jetpack, Repair Unit.WEAPONS: switch 1-5: CANNON, ARM CANNON, CLAWS, EYE LASER, HEAVY are smooth 3D models (no blocky pixel look), in the hand in 3rd person and on screen in 1st personWEBSITEWEST STREETWHERE DO YOU START?  (WITH YOUWPNWait for the SUPPLY HELICOPTER (after waves 5, 10, 15, 20, then every 10).WaitCallbackWaithandle array may not be empty.Waiting for more players to skipWalk into small buildings to smash them.Walk up and talk to the crew (Walk up beside a side door (about 7 m): it slides open, a crew member stands inside looking at you. Walk away: it slides shutWalk up beside a side door (not the front or back): it slides open.Walk up to a SIDE DOOR of the helicopter and talk to the crew: repairs, weapons, upgradesWalk up to a side door and talk to the crew (Walk up to the crew by the helicopter: repairs, weapons, upgradesWant full HP after every wave? SETTINGS > AUTO-REPAIR: ON.Warning! Feedback is deprecated. This property does nothing.Warning! roomRolloffFactor is no longer supported.Warning: Reflection Probe Atlas visualization not supported for the current rendering path. Switch to Forward+ or Deferred+ to use this debug view.Warning: STP Overlay Not Active. Enable STP upscaling filter in the render pipeline asset to use these debug view.Warning: The current render pipeline does not have Render Graphs RegisteredWarning: This platform might not support wireframe rendering.Warning: the debug shader variants are missing. Ensure that the "Strip Runtime Debug Shaders" option is disabled in the SRP Graphics Settings.WarpWarp FlashWatch for h